---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: onlyLegion
    q_auth --> q_guards: whenNotPaused, whenSaleEnded, whenSaleNotCanceled, whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guards --> q_verify: verifyCanPublishCapitalRaised()
    q_verify --> q_set: totalCapitalRaised = capitalRaised
    q_set --> [*]: emit CapitalRaisedPublished(capitalRaised)

    note right of q_verify
        INV-001: capitalRaised can only be published once (totalCapitalRaised must be 0)
        INV-002: only Legion can set the capital raised amount
        INV-003: capitalRaised is an off-chain calculated value set by Legion
    end note
